---
// Type embedding promotion hazards (#10): leaking sync.Mutex methods and time.Time.MarshalJSON.
const W = 900;
const H = 368;

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}

const aTop = arrow(310, 96, 354, 96);
const aBot = arrow(310, 266, 354, 266);
---
<figure class="gp12d">
  <div class="gp12d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: embedding sync.Mutex promotes Lock and Unlock onto BadCache's public API. Bottom: embedding time.Time promotes MarshalJSON with time.Time as receiver, so json.Marshal drops ID and Name.">
    {/* Top: mutex leak */}
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Embedding sync.Mutex promotes Lock() and Unlock() outward</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Nhúng ẩn danh sync.Mutex làm lộ Lock() và Unlock() ra ngoài</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="44" width="288" height="104" rx="6" class="hot" />
    <text x="36" y="68" class="b">type BadCache struct</text>
    <text x="36" y="92" class="r">  sync.Mutex  (embedded)</text>
    <text x="36" y="116" class="m">  items map[string]string</text>
    <text x="36" y="138" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>fix: name the field mu sync.Mutex</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>sửa: đặt tên field mu sync.Mutex</tspan>
    </text>

    <g><path d={aTop.line} class="lnr" /><polygon points={aTop.head} class="arr" /></g>

    <rect x="358" y="44" width="522" height="104" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="376" y="72" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>c.Lock() and c.Unlock() compile in external packages</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>c.Lock() và c.Unlock() gọi được từ bên ngoài package</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="376" y="98" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Callers can hold or corrupt internal lock state.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bên gọi có thể tự ý khóa hoặc làm kẹt lock nội bộ.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="376" y="124" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>With mu sync.Mutex, c.Lock() is a compile error.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nếu đổi thành mu sync.Mutex, c.Lock() bị chặn ngay lúc build.</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="170" y2="170" class="rule" />

    {/* Bottom: time.Time MarshalJSON */}
    <text x="20" y="198" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Embedding time.Time promotes MarshalJSON() and drops sibling fields</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Nhúng time.Time kéo theo MarshalJSON() và làm rơi sạch các field khác</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="214" width="288" height="104" rx="6" class="hot" />
    <text x="36" y="238" class="b">type Event struct</text>
    <text x="36" y="262" class="r">  time.Time   (embedded)</text>
    <text x="36" y="286" class="m">  ID int; Name string</text>
    <text x="36" y="308" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>fix: name the field At time.Time</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>sửa: đặt tên field At time.Time</tspan>
    </text>

    <g><path d={aBot.line} class="lnr" /><polygon points={aBot.head} class="arr" /></g>

    <rect x="358" y="214" width="522" height="104" rx="6" class="hot" />
    <text x="376" y="242" class="b">json.Marshal(ev)</text>
    <text x="376" y="268" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Output: "2026-11-23T09:00:00Z"  (ID and Name vanished)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Kết quả: "2026-11-23T09:00:00Z"  (ID và Name biến mất)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="376" y="294" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Event satisfies json.Marshaler via time.Time's method.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Event tự khớp json.Marshaler nhờ method của time.Time.</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="348" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Receiver rule: promoted methods still run with the inner field (time.Time) as receiver, not Event.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Luật receiver: method được promote vẫn chạy với field bên trong (time.Time) làm receiver, không phải Event.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Embedding without a field name promotes all exported methods of the inner type onto the outer struct, including locking primitives and interface implementations like <code>MarshalJSON</code>.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nhúng struct không đặt tên field sẽ đẩy toàn bộ method public của kiểu bên trong ra struct ngoài, bao gồm cả khóa mutex lẫn các method thỏa interface như <code>MarshalJSON</code>.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp12d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp12d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp12d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp12d text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp12d .h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp12d .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp12d .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .gp12d .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .gp12d .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp12d .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gp12d .lnr { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp12d .arr { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp12d .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp12d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
